      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* Bump setuptools dependency by @jayjb in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/496\r\n* docs: fix config file precedence order in README by @Socialpranker in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/500\r\n* Fix honeycred handling by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/507\r\n* fix(httpproxy): log NTLM proxy-auth attempts instead of exiting by @Socialpranker in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/501\r\n* Implement connection limits for the Telnet module by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/510\r\n* Fix HTTP proxy Basic Auth credential decoding by @sol-hermes85 in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/487\r\n* Fix HTTPProxy handling of injected HTML by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/508\r\n* Add connection limits to the git module by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/509\r\n* Bump idna from 3.7 to 3.15 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/485\r\n* Bump idna from 3.7 to 3.15 in /docs by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/486\r\n* Fix ReDoS in the MongoDB module's SCRAM username extraction by @thinkst-devdua in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/512\r\n* Update dependencies by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/511\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Socialpranker made their first contribution in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/500\r\n* @sol-hermes85 made their first contribution in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/487\r\n* @thinkst-devdua made their first contribution in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/512\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/compare/v0.9.9...v0.9.10",
