      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Expand testing by @thinkst-pieter in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/482\r\n* Fix MongoDB DoS reported by @arkmarta  in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/490\r\n* Improve MongoDB reliability in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/490\r\n* Remove PDF dependencies and fix pre-commit uv handling by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/489\r\n* Update dependencies inline with dependabot recommendations by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/492\r\n* Bump version to v0.9.9 by @thinkst-marco in https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/pull/495\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/compare/v0.9.8...v0.9.9",
