      "summary": "Denial-of-Service in Redis module",
      "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nThe Redis module is vulnerable to a protocol DoS. The running process does not not release memory in certain situations, leading to memory exhaustion.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nThe issue is patched in OpenCanary v0.9.10.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nDisable the Redis module by setting `\"redis.enabled\": false` in opencanary.conf.",
