      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thinkst/opencanary/security-advisories/GHSA-vg37-pc42-q265",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/thinkst/opencanary/security/advisories/GHSA-vg37-pc42-q265",
      "summary": "Denial-of-Service in MongoDB module",
      "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nThe MongoDB module is vulnerable to a single-packet DoS. When triggered, the Twisted process will consume all available time on its CPU core.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nThe issue is patched in OpenCanary v0.9.9.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nDisable the MongoDB module by setting `\"mongodb.enabled\": false` in `opencanary.conf`.\r\n",
